  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "芋头",
      "anchor": "taro",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 16°C - 38°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 45 - 100 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 45 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 60$()$(br2)芋头是单格作物。水田里的淀粉块茎，煮熟后绵软。$(br2)先开垦$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()，再在上方备好一格深淡水水源，最后对水下农田播种。完全成熟后破坏收获食材和种子。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "莲藕",
      "anchor": "lotus",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 16°C - 38°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 70 - 100 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 45 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 60$()$(br2)莲藕是单格作物。淤泥里的藕节，切开满是孔洞。$(br2)先开垦$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()，再在上方备好一格深淡水水源，最后对水下农田播种。完全成熟后破坏收获食材和种子。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "慈菇",
      "anchor": "arrowhead",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 14°C - 34°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 60 - 100 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 45 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 55$()$(br2)慈菇是单格作物。带尖芽的球茎，微苦回甘。$(br2)先开垦$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()，再在上方备好一格深淡水水源，最后对水下农田播种。完全成熟后破坏收获食材和种子。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "山药",
      "anchor": "yam",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 15°C - 36°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 40 - 85 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 50 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 30 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 60$()$(br2)山药是$(thing)攀爬性作物$()。地下长条块茎，削皮手会痒。$(br2)种子播在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，上方留空，用木棍右键下半株搭架才能继续长高。完全成熟后破坏任意半株收获并返种、返棍，各结算一次；空手右键不采摘。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "en_us",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Taro",
      "anchor": "taro",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): 16°C - 38°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 45 - 100 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 45 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 60$()$(br2)Taro is a single block crop: a starchy tuber grown in paddies.$(br2)Prepare $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$(), cover it with a one-block-deep fresh water source, then sow on the submerged farmland. Once fully grown, break the crop to harvest food and seeds.$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "en_us",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Lotus",
      "anchor": "lotus",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): 16°C - 38°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 70 - 100 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 45 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 60$()$(br2)Lotus is a single block crop: a rhizome riddled with air channels.$(br2)Prepare $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$(), cover it with a one-block-deep fresh water source, then sow on the submerged farmland. Once fully grown, break the crop to harvest food and seeds.$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "en_us",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Arrowhead",
      "anchor": "arrowhead",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): 14°C - 34°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 60 - 100 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 45 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 55$()$(br2)Arrowhead is a single block crop: a beaked tuber with a bitter edge.$(br2)Prepare $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$(), cover it with a one-block-deep fresh water source, then sow on the submerged farmland. Once fully grown, break the crop to harvest food and seeds.$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "en_us",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Yam",
      "anchor": "yam",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): 15°C - 36°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 40 - 85 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 50 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 30 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 60$()$(br2)Yam is a $(thing)climbing crop$(): a long underground tuber.$(br2)Sow on $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$() with space above. To grow tall, right-click the lower plant with a wooden stick. Once fully grown, break either half to harvest and return seeds and the stick once. Empty-hand right-click does not harvest.$(br2)"
    }
  },
